@OrganizerApi = https://localhost:7225

### Create an organizer event (automatically syncs to KMC.Api)
POST {{OrganizerApi}}/api/Events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Kandy Heritage Music Evening",
  "description": "A cultural music evening organized by Sparkling Events Kandy.",
  "eventType": "Cultural",
  "eventDate": "2026-11-15",
  "startTime": "17:00:00",
  "endTime": "21:00:00",
  "venue": "Kandy Heritage Centre",
  "location": "Kandy",
  "organizerName": "Sparkling Events Kandy",
  "isPublished": true
}

### Get all organizer events
GET {{OrganizerApi}}/api/Events
Accept: application/json

### Retry KMC synchronization
POST {{OrganizerApi}}/api/Events/1/publish-to-kmc

### Delete an organizer event
DELETE {{OrganizerApi}}/api/Events/1
